      "writtenOn": "2024-09-25T16:42:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The IR builder doesn\u0027t do that: https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/tint/lang/core/ir/builder.cc;l\u003d68\n\nBut the GLSL printer does when it emits names, so maybe it\u0027s OK? I guess we don\u0027t care that much about uniqueness of names in the intermediate IR, although disassemblies might get confusing.",
      "parentUuid": "8aef670b_df55e9f2",
      "revId": "42fd29d66c47e7e4eab735b840d040d7cff09abc",
